/*
 * Implements validation and construction of map literal values.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of key/value pairs in map literals,
 *   - type inference for key and value types,
 *   - construction of MapType and MapValue nodes,
 *   - creation of typeinfo for map types,
 *   - and enforcement of copy-context rules for map construction.
 *
 * Map literals must be enclosed in a copy expression unless empty. Deep copy
 * of map literals is prohibited.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::compose::map
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/compose/map.yr
 * @Author(s):
